      "name": "unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF",
      "description": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF 是经由 Unsloth 优化的 Qwen3.6 量化版本，专门适配 GGUF 推理格式。该模型在保持原有模型推理性能的基础上，显著降低了显存占用，提升了加载与运行效率。它特别支持开发者角色模式与改进的工具调用机制，非常适合在个人电脑或轻量级推理设备上高效运行并进行模型微调。",
      "source_description": "Read our How to Run Qwen3.6 Guide! <div> <p style=\"margin: 0 0 0px 0; margin-top: 0px;\"> <em>See <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/basics/unsloth-dynamic-v2.0-gguf\">Unsloth Dynamic 2.0 GGUFs</a> for our quantization benchmarks.</em> </p> <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 5px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0px;\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/raw/main/images/unsloth%20new%20logo.png\" width=\"133\"> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/unsloth\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/raw/main/images/Discord%20button.png\" width=\"173\"> </a> <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/models/qwen3.6\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/unslothai/unsloth/refs/heads/main/images/documentation%20green%20button.png\" width=\"143\"> </a> </div> <ul style=\"margin: 0;\"> <li>NEW: Developer Role Support so Qwen3.6 can work in Codex, OpenCode and more!</li> <li>Qwen3.6 can now be run and fine-tuned in <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/new/studio\">Unsloth Studio</a>. <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/models/qwen3.6\">Read our guide</a>.</li> <li>Tool calling improvements: Makes parsing nested objects to make tool calling succeed more.</li> <li>Example of Qwen3.6 (4-bit GGUF) running in Unsloth Studio with tool-calling:</li> </ul> </div> <img width=\"600\" alt=\"qwen3.6 in unsloth studio\" src=\"https://cdn-uploads.huggingface.co/production/uploads/62ecdc18b72a69615d6bd857/wRyC xcMidEnz4INKA1b-.gif\" />",
